      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Adding this feature would expand the range of expression and make various things possible.\n\nAs already mentioned, since Avatar Scale can be controlled from the Action menu, I believe it should also be operable from the Animator.\n\nEven if it doesn't use parameter drivers, I would like to see it implemented with a new State Behavior or similar approach.",
